<dialog class="game-play-dialog"
	data-controller="game-play-modal"
	aria-labelledby="game-play-title">
  <button class="game-play-close"
	  type="button"
	  aria-label="Close game information"
	  data-action="game-play-modal#close">×</button>

  <h1 id="game-play-title">WELCOME TO DOWN THE RABBIT HOLE</h1>

  <p>THIS IS AN INTERACTIVE GAME THAT INVOLVES BEING TAGGED ON THE BACK (ABOVE THE WAIST ONLY)</p>

  <p>TO OPT OUT OF THE GAME, PLEASE CLICK <%= link_to "HERE", opt_out_path %></p>

  <p>ANY INAPPROPRIATE BEHAVIOR/HARASSMENT WILL GET YOU KICKED OUT IMMEDIATELY</p>

  <p>READY?</p>
  <p>PLUG INTO THE MATRIX <%= link_to "HERE", "#", data: { action: "game-play-modal#close" } %></p>
</dialog>